Package: poolpilot
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: PoolPilot Maintainers <noreply@poolpilot.invalid>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: ca-certificates, libc6, libgcc-s1, libssl3 | libssl3t64, libstdc++6, zlib1g
Description: PoolPilot Lighter pool observation and copy-trading workbench
 PoolPilot observes Lighter public pools, records paper copy-trading ledgers,
 and exposes an anonymous public read surface when explicitly enabled.
 .
 The package contains a self-contained ASP.NET Core runtime, the built web
 frontend, and a systemd unit. Application data lives in /var/lib/poolpilot.
